<!-- codex-luna-swarm:start -->
## Luna subagents

When the operator explicitly requests Luna agents or a Luna swarm, use `$codex-luna-swarm`.
Preserve the requested Luna identity; do not substitute Sol, Terra, or a coordinator. Keep lanes
read-only unless the operator authorises writes, and give every write lane explicit ownership.
The skill owns native spawning, the compatibility launcher, collection, and limits; do not read or
reimplement its launcher in the main session.
<!-- codex-luna-swarm:end -->
